research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-refuter-thm-limit-comparison-test.prompt.md-91-title: "For $a_k, b_k > 0$ with $a_k/b_k \\to L$: if $L \\in (0,\\infty)$ the two series share their behaviour, while $L = 0$ and $L = \\infty$ give one implication each"
