research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-refuter-thm-limit-comparison-test.prompt.md-201-
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-refuter-thm-limit-comparison-test.prompt.md-202-- **The limit is only used through an eventual two-sided estimate.** No step needs the exact value of $L$, only that $q_k$ is eventually trapped strictly between two positive multiples of it. That is why the test still works when the quotients merely stay between two positive constants, and why the hypothesis $\lim_k q_k = L$ is stronger than what the proof consumes.
